WEBVTT

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:11.570
Choose Videos in the side menu.

00:00:12.132 --> 00:00:18.132
Type "Counting" in the Search box.

00:00:19.429 --> 00:00:25.429
Click Counting Money in
Naira to open the video.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:34.040
Scroll to Maturity rating.

00:00:34.317 --> 00:00:40.317
Select G from Maturity rating.

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:47.240
Click Save changes.

00:00:53.301 --> 00:00:59.301
Scroll to Before you publish.

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:05.620
Scroll to How viewers see it.
